      "content": "I'm having a hard time following the metaphors you're using. Can we focus strictly on the technical and structural aspects? \n\nSpecifically, please explain the mechanical and chemical reasons why the rack geometry impedes the vapor cloud dispersion and why the water droplets from an overhead sprinkler might fail to penetrate the lower tiers of a dense storage configuration.",
